  "notes": [
    "Checked against ComfyUI v0.39.2 (commit 3c1b7a17fdf239d35ce98cc777756f572d089795): every class_type and input name was read from its source on 2026-10-09 (comfy_extras/nodes_qwen.py, nodes_flux.py, nodes_cfg.py; tests/test_runpod_worker.py COMFY_NODES); never run.",
    "Stage 1 follows the official template image_qwen_image_edit_2511.json (Comfy-Org/workflow_templates): UNETLoader qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed + CLIPLoader type qwen_image (the same Qwen2.5-VL fp8 text encoder and VAE as the 2512 route) + ModelSamplingAuraFlow 3.1 + CFGNorm 1 + the Lightning 4-step LoRA, KSampler euler/simple. Picture 1 goes through FluxKontextImageScale; pictures 1-3 reach both TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus nodes (the positive with the prompt, the negative empty) with the VAE, so they are also reference latents; both conditionings go through FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod index_timestep_zero.",
    "The Owner chose the Lightning 4-step LoRA (card 2026-10-09): the template's switch is fixed to its 'on' branch (4 steps, CFG 1), because the switch node is not needed in core and a fixed graph is what the bake-off measures. At CFG 1 the negative conditioning does not steer the sampler.",
    "Departure from the template: the latent is an empty 9:16 928x1664 latent (EmptySD3LatentImage, Qwen-Image's 9:16 size) instead of picture 1's size, so every still has the delivered aspect. Whether 2511 keeps the character's identity this way is UNPROVEN: the bake-off compares it with padding picture 1 to 9:16.",
    "Stage 2 is the 2512 route's SeedVR2 stage unchanged: the render is center-cropped and Lanczos-scaled to exactly 1530x2720, then SeedVR2-7B restores it at that size.",
    "References: reference_image (required), reference_image_2 and reference_image_3 are the item's first three reference_images in the studio's order (the character's identity sheet first). The worker prunes the LoadImage of an empty slot and the links to it (image2/image3 are optional inputs). The prompt is the scene's own text; Qwen names the pictures 'Picture 1..3' inside the encoder, so a prompt may refer to them that way.",
    "Licences: Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 and its Lightning LoRA are Apache-2.0 (Hugging Face tags on Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511, Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI, lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning)."
  ],
